  "process_development_narrative": [
    "W/O system with high internal water phase is treated as the core formula/process context.",
    "Viscosity is linked to particle size, homogenization speed/time, and M4E venturi speed/timer.",
    "50kg/100kg Symex trials show recirculation, operation, or stability challenges that affect scale-up confidence.",
    "M4E parameters are studied across multiple VL/TC batches to compare route feasibility and output quality.",
    "Lee Trimix plus M4E / Oevel route appears more feasible based on the captured batch evidence.",
    "Process parameters need tight control because viscosity and specification outcomes are sensitive."
